  "solution": {
    "text": "Reaction between alkyl halide, aryl halide and sodium in presence of ether is known as Wurtz fitting reaction\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{C}_6 \\mathrm{H}_5 \\mathrm{Cl}+2 \\mathrm{Na}+\\mathrm{ClCH}_3 \\longrightarrow \\\\\n& \\mathrm{C}_6 \\mathrm{H}_5 \\mathrm{CH}_3+2 \\mathrm{NaCl}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nToluene",
